  "overlays": [
    "TORN_TAIL blocks; acknowledgement is explicit, byte-bound and never erases a valid complete event",
    "CORRUPT blocks whole log including an earlier terminal prefix",
    "recorded faults take precedence over readable bytes",
    "TERMINATED_EXTERNALLY is evaluated only by external fault-log join, never pure log projection",
    "nonterminal refusals write nothing except the P1 BEGIN_CANCELLED exception"
  ]
